### get all users
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/


### get one user
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/13/


### Create user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Chardlie",
    "password": "jakoba",
    "first_name": "Jakob",
    "last_name": "van Bezooijen",
    "email": "jvbezooijden1@gmail.com",
    "is_staff": false,
    "is_active": true,
    "role": "admin"
}

### update user
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/13/update/
Content-Type: application/application/json

{
